{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/robokit.RoboKit\/documentation\/RoboKit\/SocketModule","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This module enables structured and concurrent-safe communication between a TCP client and server. The server listens on a given port for incoming client connections, while the client initiates a connection and can send encoded messages. The enconding and decoding process can be facilitated by the "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/robokit.RoboKit\/documentation\/RoboKit\/CodingManager","isActive":true},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"text":"TCPClient","level":2,"anchor":"TCPClient","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An actor responsible for managing the lifecycle of a TCP client."}]},{"text":"Initialization","anchor":"Initialization","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To initialize your TCP client, simply initialize the actor with the host and port you wish to connect to and assing it to a variable."}]},{"code":["let client = TCPClient(host: \"localhost\", port: 12345)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Start Connection","anchor":"Start-Connection"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Once ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/robokit.RoboKit\/documentation\/RoboKit\/TCPClient"},{"type":"text","text":" has been instantiated, the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"startConnection"},{"text":" method can be called in order to stablish a connection to the server.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["await client.startConnection(value: encodedData)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"value","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": The ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data"},{"text":" to send after connecting.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Responsibilities","level":3,"text":"Responsibilities","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Connects to a TCP server."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sends encoded data following the establishment of the connection."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Sets up state and receive handlers.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"TCPServer","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"TCPServer"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An actor responsible for creating and managing a TCP server listener, handling multiple concurrent client connections."}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The usage of the TCPServer is not a necessary addition to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/robokit.RoboKit\/documentation\/RoboKit\/TCPClient","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}],"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note"},{"level":3,"text":"Initialization","anchor":"Initialization","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initialize the server designating a port it can listen on."}]},{"code":["let server = try await TCPServer(port: 12345)"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"anchor":"Start-Listening","level":3,"text":"Start Listening","type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Call the start method to allow the server to start listening for possible connections.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["try await server.start(logMessage: \"Server started\")"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Responsibilities","text":"Responsibilities","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Creates and starts an "},{"code":"NWListener","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Accepts and manages multiple client connections.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Instantiates a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Connection"},{"text":" actor for each client.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"type":"heading","text":"Connection","anchor":"Connection","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An actor that encapsulates a TCP connection between the server and a single client. Utilize the Connections properties to add custom behavior.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Properties","anchor":"Properties"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"setupConnection","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": Called when connection enters the setup state.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"waitingConnection","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": Called when the connection is waiting for network resources."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"preparingConnection","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": Called when preparing to be ready."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"readyConnection","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": Called when connection is established and ready.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"failedConnection"},{"type":"text","text":": Called if the connection fails."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cancelledConnection"},{"type":"text","text":": Called when the connection is cancelled."}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":3,"anchor":"Lifecycle","text":"Lifecycle","type":"heading"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"State updates are monitored via ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NWConnection.State"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"setupReceive","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" begins the data reception loop."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"send(data:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" transmits messages."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"level":2,"text":"CodingManager","type":"heading","anchor":"CodingManager"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A utility responsible for encoding and decoding JSON messages sent between the client and server. Uses the shared ","type":"text"},{"code":"AppLogger","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for debugging and error reporting."}]},{"level":3,"text":"Encode JSON","anchor":"Encode-JSON","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Encodes any value conforming to "},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let data = CodingManager.encodeToJSON(data: messageModel)"]},{"level":3,"anchor":"Decode-JSON","type":"heading","text":"Decode JSON"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Decodes a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data"},{"type":"text","text":" instance back to the expected "},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" model."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["let model: CPRMessageModel = try CodingManager.decodeFromJSON(data: receivedData)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","anchor":"Responsibilities","text":"Responsibilities"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"encodeToJSON<T>(data:)"},{"type":"text","text":": Serializes a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Codable"},{"type":"text","text":" instance to JSON "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"decodeFromJSON<T>(data:)"},{"text":": Deserializes JSON ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Data"},{"type":"text","text":" to a "},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instance.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Logs success and failure messages to the ","type":"text"},{"code":".socket","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" log category.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"name":"Important","style":"important","type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Logging is dispatched to the main actor for thread safety.","type":"text"}]}]},{"anchor":"CPRMessageModel","type":"heading","text":"CPRMessageModel","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A codable model for transmitting robot control data such as claw state and position\/rotation values. Ideal for robots that only require this data to be operated, such as a fixed manipulator.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Initialization","anchor":"Initialization","type":"heading","level":3},{"code":["let message = CPRMessageModel(clawControl: true, positionAndRotation: [0.0, 1.0, 2.0])"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Properties","anchor":"Properties"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"code":"clawControl","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": A ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Bool"},{"type":"text","text":" indicating whether the robot claw should be open ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"text":") or closed (","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":")."}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"positionAndRotation","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":": An array of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Float"},{"text":" values representing spatial coordinates and rotation.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anc